### ============================================================
### 试题库 + 试卷 API 全流程测试
###
### 功能架构：
###   题库（questions）：题目与课程/章节/小节绑定，独立存储，可复用
###   试卷（quizzes/exams）：从题库组卷，支持自定义分值和排序
###
### API 路由：
###   题库：POST|GET /api/courses/:course_id/questions[/:question_id]
###   试卷：POST|GET /api/courses/:course_id/exams[/:exam_id[/publish]]
###   组卷：POST|GET /api/exams/:exam_id/questions[/:entry_id]
###
### 认证：Teacher / Admin（路由层强制），写操作 Handler 层校验课程所有权
### Base：http://localhost:8080
### ============================================================

@base = http://localhost:8080

# 以下变量在每次 Run 前手动填入（或从对应响应中复制）
@teacher_token = REPLACE_WITH_TEACHER_JWT
@course_id     = REPLACE_WITH_COURSE_UUID
@chapter_id    = REPLACE_WITH_CHAPTER_UUID
@video_id      = REPLACE_WITH_VIDEO_UUID

# 运行后从响应中填入
@question_id_1  = REPLACE_AFTER_STEP_2a
@question_id_2  = REPLACE_AFTER_STEP_2b
@question_id_3  = REPLACE_AFTER_STEP_2c
@question_id_4  = REPLACE_AFTER_STEP_2d
@exam_id        = REPLACE_AFTER_STEP_4
@entry_id_1     = REPLACE_AFTER_STEP_6a
@entry_id_2     = REPLACE_AFTER_STEP_6b


### ============================================================
### 步骤 0：登录（使用教师账号）
### ============================================================

# @name login_teacher
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "teacher01",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 预期响应（200 OK）：
### {
###   "token": "eyJ...",
###   "token_type": "Bearer",
###   "expires_at": 1770000000,
###   "user": { "id": "uuid", "role": "Teacher", ... }
### }
### → 复制 token 填入顶部 @teacher_token


### ============================================================
### 步骤 1：查看课程题库（初始为空）
### ============================================================

# @name list_questions_empty
GET {{base}}/api/courses/{{course_id}}/questions
Authorization: Bearer {{teacher_token}}

### 预期响应（200 OK）：
### []


### ============================================================
### 步骤 2a：向题库添加【单选题】
### ============================================================

# @name create_single_choice
POST {{base}}/api/courses/{{course_id}}/questions
Authorization: Bearer {{teacher_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "chapter_id": "{{chapter_id}}",
  "video_id": "{{video_id}}",
  "question_type": "single_choice",
  "content": "Rust 中哪个关键字用于声明不可变变量？",
  "options": [
    { "key": "A", "text": "var" },
    { "key": "B", "text": "let" },
    { "key": "C", "text": "const" },
    { "key": "D", "text": "mut" }
  ],
  "correct_answer": "B",
  "explanation": "Rust 中 let 声明的变量默认不可变；mut 关键字用于声明可变变量；const 用于编译期常量。",
  "default_score": 5
}

### 预期响应（201 Created）：
### {
###   "id": "uuid",                   ← 填入 @question_id_1
###   "course_id": "...",
###   "chapter_id": "...",
###   "video_id": "...",
###   "created_by": "...",
###   "question_type": "single_choice",
###   "content": "Rust 中哪个关键字用于声明不可变变量？",
###   "options": [{"key":"A","text":"var"}, ...],
###   "correct_answer": "B",
###   "explanation": "...",
###   "default_score": "5",
###   "created_at": "...",
###   "updated_at": "..."
### }


### ============================================================
### 步骤 2b：向题库添加【多选题】
### ============================================================

# @name create_multiple_choice
POST {{base}}/api/courses/{{course_id}}/questions
Authorization: Bearer {{teacher_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "chapter_id": "{{chapter_id}}",
  "question_type": "multiple_choice",
  "content": "以下哪些属于 Rust 的所有权规则？（多选）",
  "options": [
    { "key": "A", "text": "每个值都有一个所有者" },
    { "key": "B", "text": "同一时刻可以有多个可变引用" },
    { "key": "C", "text": "所有者离开作用域时值被丢弃" },
    { "key": "D", "text": "同一时刻只能有一个所有者" }
  ],
  "correct_answer": ["A", "C", "D"],
  "explanation": "Rust 所有权三条规则：每个值有且仅有一个所有者；同一时刻只有一个所有者；所有者离开作用域时，值被丢弃。同一时刻只能有一个可变引用（B 错误）。",
  "default_score": 10
}

### 预期响应（201 Created）：
### { "id": "uuid", "question_type": "multiple_choice", ... }
### → 复制 id 填入 @question_id_2


### ============================================================
### 步骤 2c：向题库添加【判断题】
### ============================================================

# @name create_true_false
POST {{base}}/api/courses/{{course_id}}/questions
Authorization: Bearer {{teacher_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "chapter_id": "{{chapter_id}}",
  "question_type": "true_false",
  "content": "Rust 中，不可变引用可以在同一作用域内同时存在多个。",
  "options": null,
  "correct_answer": true,
  "explanation": "Rust 允许同一时刻存在多个不可变引用（共享借用），但不能同时存在可变引用和不可变引用。",
  "default_score": 5
}

### 预期响应（201 Created）：
### { "id": "uuid", "question_type": "true_false", "correct_answer": true, ... }
### → 复制 id 填入 @question_id_3


### ============================================================
### 步骤 2d：向题库添加【问答题（主观题）】
### ============================================================

# @name create_essay
POST {{base}}/api/courses/{{course_id}}/questions
Authorization: Bearer {{teacher_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "chapter_id": "{{chapter_id}}",
  "question_type": "essay",
  "content": "请用你自己的语言解释 Rust 的借用检查器（Borrow Checker）的作用，并举例说明它如何防止悬垂指针。",
  "options": null,
  "correct_answer": null,
  "explanation": "参考要点：1. 借用检查器在编译期验证引用的有效性；2. 保证引用的生命周期不超过被引用值；3. 防止悬垂引用（dangling reference）；4. 举例：函数返回局部变量的引用会被拒绝编译。",
  "default_score": 20
}

### 预期响应（201 Created）：
### {
###   "id": "uuid",
###   "question_type": "essay",
###   "correct_answer": null,    ← 问答题无标准答案，人工评分
###   "default_score": "20",
###   ...
### }
### → 复制 id 填入 @question_id_4


### ============================================================
### 步骤 3：按章节筛选题库题目
### ============================================================

# @name list_questions_by_chapter
GET {{base}}/api/courses/{{course_id}}/questions?chapter_id={{chapter_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{teacher_token}}

### 预期响应（200 OK）：返回该章节下的所有题目（含 step 2a–2d 创建的 4 道题）
### [
###   { "id": "...", "question_type": "single_choice", ... },
###   { "id": "...", "question_type": "multiple_choice", ... },
###   { "id": "...", "question_type": "true_false", ... },
###   { "id": "...", "question_type": "essay", ... }
### ]

###

# @name list_questions_by_video
GET {{base}}/api/courses/{{course_id}}/questions?video_id={{video_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{teacher_token}}

### 预期响应（200 OK）：仅返回与该小节绑定的题目（step 2a 那道单选题）


### ============================================================
### 步骤 3b：获取单个题目详情
### ============================================================

# @name get_question
GET {{base}}/api/courses/{{course_id}}/questions/{{question_id_1}}
Authorization: Bearer {{teacher_token}}

### 预期响应（200 OK）：
### {
###   "id": "{{question_id_1}}",
###   "question_type": "single_choice",
###   "content": "Rust 中哪个关键字用于声明不可变变量？",
###   ...
### }


### ============================================================
### 步骤 3c：更新题目（PUT 全字段替换）
### ============================================================

# @name update_question
PUT {{base}}/api/courses/{{course_id}}/questions/{{question_id_1}}
Authorization: Bearer {{teacher_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "chapter_id": "{{chapter_id}}",
  "video_id": "{{video_id}}",
  "question_type": "single_choice",
  "content": "Rust 中哪个关键字用于声明默认不可变的变量？（已更新）",
  "options": [
    { "key": "A", "text": "var" },
    { "key": "B", "text": "let" },
    { "key": "C", "text": "const" },
    { "key": "D", "text": "static" }
  ],
  "correct_answer": "B",
  "explanation": "let 声明的变量默认不可变。const 是编译期常量，static 是静态变量。",
  "default_score": 5
}

### 预期响应（200 OK）：返回更新后的完整题目对象
### 注意：PUT 语义，所有字段均需提供；chapter_id/video_id 发 null 会将其清除

###

### 将题目的小节关联清除（chapter_id、video_id 置为 null）
# @name update_question_clear_video
PUT {{base}}/api/courses/{{course_id}}/questions/{{question_id_4}}
Authorization: Bearer {{teacher_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "chapter_id": null,
  "video_id": null,
  "question_type": "essay",
  "content": "请用你自己的语言解释 Rust 的借用检查器（Borrow Checker）的作用，并举例说明它如何防止悬垂指针。",
  "options": null,
  "correct_answer": null,
  "explanation": "参考要点：借用检查器在编译期验证引用有效性，防止悬垂引用。",
  "default_score": 25
}

### 预期响应（200 OK）：chapter_id = null, video_id = null, default_score = 25


### ============================================================
### 步骤 4：创建试卷
### ============================================================

# @name create_exam
POST {{base}}/api/courses/{{course_id}}/exams
Authorization: Bearer {{teacher_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "course_id": "{{course_id}}",
  "chapter_id": null,
  "title": "第一章 Rust 基础知识测试",
  "description": "涵盖所有权、借用和基础语法的综合测试，满分 40 分，60% 及格。",
  "time_limit": 30,
  "total_score": 40,
  "pass_score": 24,
  "max_attempts": 3
}

### 预期响应（201 Created）：
### {
###   "id": "uuid",                   ← 填入 @exam_id
###   "course_id": "...",
###   "chapter_id": null,
###   "title": "第一章 Rust 基础知识测试",
###   "description": "...",
###   "time_limit": 30,
###   "total_score": "40",
###   "pass_score": "24",
###   "max_attempts": 3,
###   "is_published": false,
###   "created_at": "...",
###   "updated_at": "..."
### }


### ============================================================
### 步骤 5：查看课程所有试卷
### ============================================================

# @name list_exams
GET {{base}}/api/courses/{{course_id}}/exams
Authorization: Bearer {{teacher_token}}

### 预期响应（200 OK）：返回该课程的所有试卷列表（含 step 4 创建的试卷）
### [
###   { "id": "...", "title": "第一章 Rust 基础知识测试", "is_published": false, ... }
### ]


### ============================================================
### 步骤 5b：获取试卷详情（含题目列表，初始为空）
### ============================================================

# @name get_exam_empty
GET {{base}}/api/courses/{{course_id}}/exams/{{exam_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{teacher_token}}

### 预期响应（200 OK）：
### {
###   "id": "{{exam_id}}",
###   "title": "第一章 Rust 基础知识测试",
###   "is_published": false,
###   "questions": [],            ← 尚未组卷
###   "computed_total_score": 0,
###   ...
### }


### ============================================================
### 步骤 6a：向试卷添加第一道题（单选题，使用默认分值）
### ============================================================

# @name add_question_1
POST {{base}}/api/exams/{{exam_id}}/questions
Authorization: Bearer {{teacher_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question_id": "{{question_id_1}}",
  "sort_order": 1
}

### 预期响应（201 Created）：
### {
###   "entry_id": "uuid",             ← 填入 @entry_id_1
###   "quiz_id": "{{exam_id}}",
###   "question_id": "{{question_id_1}}",
###   "score": null,                  ← null 表示沿用 default_score（5分）
###   "sort_order": 1,
###   "question_type": "single_choice",
###   "content": "Rust 中哪个关键字...",
###   "options": [...],
###   "correct_answer": "B",
###   "default_score": "5",
###   ...
### }


### ============================================================
### 步骤 6b：添加第二道题（多选题，自定义分值覆盖默认值）
### ============================================================

# @name add_question_2
POST {{base}}/api/exams/{{exam_id}}/questions
Authorization: Bearer {{teacher_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question_id": "{{question_id_2}}",
  "score": 12,
  "sort_order": 2
}

### 预期响应（201 Created）：
### {
###   "entry_id": "uuid",             ← 填入 @entry_id_2
###   "score": "12",                  ← 自定义分值，覆盖 default_score（10分）
###   "question_type": "multiple_choice",
###   ...
### }


### ============================================================
### 步骤 6c：添加判断题（sort_order 3）
### ============================================================

# @name add_question_3
POST {{base}}/api/exams/{{exam_id}}/questions
Authorization: Bearer {{teacher_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question_id": "{{question_id_3}}",
  "sort_order": 3
}


### ============================================================
### 步骤 6d：添加问答题（sort_order 4）
### ============================================================

# @name add_question_4
POST {{base}}/api/exams/{{exam_id}}/questions
Authorization: Bearer {{teacher_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question_id": "{{question_id_4}}",
  "sort_order": 4
}


### ============================================================
### 步骤 7：查看试卷组题列表
### ============================================================

# @name list_exam_questions
GET {{base}}/api/exams/{{exam_id}}/questions
Authorization: Bearer {{teacher_token}}

### 预期响应（200 OK）：按 sort_order 排列的 4 道题
### [
###   {
###     "entry_id": "...",
###     "quiz_id": "{{exam_id}}",
###     "question_id": "...",
###     "score": null,
###     "sort_order": 1,
###     "question_type": "single_choice",
###     "content": "Rust 中哪个关键字...",
###     "correct_answer": "B",
###     "default_score": "5",
###     ...
###   },
###   { "sort_order": 2, "question_type": "multiple_choice", "score": "12", ... },
###   { "sort_order": 3, "question_type": "true_false", ... },
###   { "sort_order": 4, "question_type": "essay", "correct_answer": null, ... }
### ]


### ============================================================
### 步骤 7b：查看试卷详情（含实际总分计算）
### ============================================================

# @name get_exam_with_questions
GET {{base}}/api/courses/{{course_id}}/exams/{{exam_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{teacher_token}}

### 预期响应（200 OK）：
### {
###   "id": "{{exam_id}}",
###   "total_score": "40",                  ← 设置的名义总分
###   "is_published": false,
###   "questions": [...],                   ← 4 道题
###   "computed_total_score": "42"          ← 实际分值：5 + 12 + 5 + 20 = 42
### }
### 注：computed_total_score 与 total_score 不一致时，建议前端给出提示


### ============================================================
### 步骤 8：调整题目分值 / 排序
### ============================================================

### 将第一道题的分值从默认 5 分改为 8 分
# @name update_entry_score
PUT {{base}}/api/exams/{{exam_id}}/questions/{{entry_id_1}}
Authorization: Bearer {{teacher_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "score": 8,
  "sort_order": 1
}

### 预期响应（200 OK）：
### {
###   "entry_id": "{{entry_id_1}}",
###   "score": "8",              ← 由 null 变为 8
###   "sort_order": 1,
###   "question_type": "single_choice",
###   ...
### }

###

### 仅调整排序（不改分值）
# @name update_entry_order
PUT {{base}}/api/exams/{{exam_id}}/questions/{{entry_id_2}}
Authorization: Bearer {{teacher_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sort_order": 10
}

### 预期响应（200 OK）：sort_order 更新为 10，score 保持不变


### ============================================================
### 步骤 9：从试卷中移除一道题（不影响题库原题）
### ============================================================

# @name remove_question_from_exam
DELETE {{base}}/api/exams/{{exam_id}}/questions/{{entry_id_2}}
Authorization: Bearer {{teacher_token}}

### 预期响应：204 No Content
### 此后 list_exam_questions 将不再包含该题；题库中 question_id_2 仍然存在

###

### 验证：题库题目依然存在
# @name verify_question_still_exists
GET {{base}}/api/courses/{{course_id}}/questions/{{question_id_2}}
Authorization: Bearer {{teacher_token}}

### 预期响应（200 OK）：题目完整返回（未被删除）


### ============================================================
### 步骤 10：更新试卷基本信息
### ============================================================

# @name update_exam
PUT {{base}}/api/courses/{{course_id}}/exams/{{exam_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{teacher_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "第一章 Rust 基础知识测试（修订版）",
  "description": "修订说明：调整了部分题目分值，总分更新为 38 分。",
  "time_limit": 45,
  "total_score": 38,
  "pass_score": 23,
  "max_attempts": null
}

### 预期响应（200 OK）：返回更新后的试卷信息
### 注：is_published 字段通过 COALESCE 保持不变（仍为 false）


### ============================================================
### 步骤 11：发布试卷（切换发布状态）
### ============================================================

# @name publish_exam
POST {{base}}/api/courses/{{course_id}}/exams/{{exam_id}}/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{teacher_token}}

### 预期响应（200 OK）：
### {
###   "exam_id": "{{exam_id}}",
###   "is_published": true,
###   "message": "试卷已发布"
### }

###

### 再次调用：取消发布（切换）
# @name unpublish_exam
POST {{base}}/api/courses/{{course_id}}/exams/{{exam_id}}/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{teacher_token}}

### 预期响应（200 OK）：
### {
###   "exam_id": "{{exam_id}}",
###   "is_published": false,
###   "message": "试卷已取消发布"
### }


### ============================================================
### 步骤 12：重复添加已存在的题目（幂等行为）
### ============================================================

# @name add_duplicate_question
POST {{base}}/api/exams/{{exam_id}}/questions
Authorization: Bearer {{teacher_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question_id": "{{question_id_1}}",
  "score": 10,
  "sort_order": 99
}

### 预期响应（201 Created）：
### ON CONFLICT DO UPDATE → 更新 score 和 sort_order，返回最新状态
### { "score": "10", "sort_order": 99, ... }


### ============================================================
### 步骤 13：跨课程组卷（权限校验）
### ============================================================

### 尝试将不属于当前课程的题目加入试卷 → 应返回 400
# @name cross_course_question_rejected
POST {{base}}/api/exams/{{exam_id}}/questions
Authorization: Bearer {{teacher_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "sort_order": 1
}

### 预期响应（404 Not Found）："题目不存在"
### 或（400 Bad Request）："该题目不属于试卷所在课程，无法加入"


### ============================================================
### 步骤 14：删除题目（会从所有试卷中级联删除 exam_questions 记录）
### ============================================================

### 先创建一道临时题目
# @name create_temp_question
POST {{base}}/api/courses/{{course_id}}/questions
Authorization: Bearer {{teacher_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question_type": "true_false",
  "content": "这是一道临时题目，将被删除。",
  "correct_answer": false,
  "default_score": 3
}

###

### 删除该题目
# @name delete_question
DELETE {{base}}/api/courses/{{course_id}}/questions/{{question_id_3}}
Authorization: Bearer {{teacher_token}}

### 预期响应：204 No Content
### 若该题已加入任何试卷，ON DELETE CASCADE 会同步删除 exam_questions 中的关联记录


### ============================================================
### 步骤 15：删除整个试卷
### ============================================================

# @name delete_exam
DELETE {{base}}/api/courses/{{course_id}}/exams/{{exam_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{teacher_token}}

### 预期响应：204 No Content
### exam_questions 中的组题记录由 ON DELETE CASCADE 自动删除；题库原题不受影响


### ============================================================
### 错误场景测试
### ============================================================

### 场景 A：创建题目 - 内容为空
# @name error_empty_content
POST {{base}}/api/courses/{{course_id}}/questions
Authorization: Bearer {{teacher_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question_type": "single_choice",
  "content": "   ",
  "default_score": 5
}

### 预期响应（400 Bad Request）："题目内容不能为空"

###

### 场景 B：获取不存在的题目
# @name error_question_not_found
GET {{base}}/api/courses/{{course_id}}/questions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{teacher_token}}

### 预期响应（404 Not Found）："题目不存在"

###

### 场景 C：未登录访问题库
# @name error_unauthenticated
GET {{base}}/api/courses/{{course_id}}/questions

### 预期响应（401 Unauthorized）

###

### 场景 D：创建试卷标题为空
# @name error_empty_exam_title
POST {{base}}/api/courses/{{course_id}}/exams
Authorization: Bearer {{teacher_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "course_id": "{{course_id}}",
  "title": "",
  "total_score": 100
}

### 预期响应（400 Bad Request）："试卷标题不能为空"

###

### 场景 E：从不存在的试卷中移除题目
# @name error_exam_not_found
DELETE {{base}}/api/exams/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/questions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Authorization: Bearer {{teacher_token}}

### 预期响应（404 Not Found）："试卷不存在"

###

### ============================================================
### 第六节：题库导出 / 导入（XLSX 格式）
###
### Excel 列结构（"题目列表" sheet，第1行为表头，第2行起为数据）：
###   A: 题目类型      single_choice / multiple_choice / true_false / essay
###   B: 题目内容      必填，不能为空
###   C: 选项A        选择题必填，其余题型留空
###   D: 选项B
###   E: 选项C
###   F: 选项D
###   G: 正确答案      单选: A  多选: A,B,D  判断: TRUE/FALSE  问答: 留空
###   H: 解析（可选）
###   I: 默认分值      数字，留空默认 5
###
### 说明 sheet："填写说明"（只读参考，导入时可忽略）
###
### 导入注意事项：
###   - 使用 multipart/form-data 上传，字段名为 "file"
###   - chapter_id / video_id 在导入时始终忽略（置为 null）
###   - 可直接上传由导出接口下载的 .xlsx 文件
###   - 每道题独立校验，失败行跳过，其余行正常写入
### ============================================================

### 6.1 导出课程全部题目（返回 .xlsx 文件下载）
# @name export_all_questions
GET {{base}}/api/courses/{{course_id}}/questions/export
Authorization: Bearer {{teacher_token}}

### 预期响应（200 OK）：
### Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet
### Content-Disposition: attachment; filename="questions_XXXXXXXX_YYYYMMDD.xlsx"
### Body: 二进制 XLSX 文件（包含"题目列表"和"填写说明"两个 Sheet）

###

### 6.2 按章节过滤后导出
# @name export_chapter_questions
GET {{base}}/api/courses/{{course_id}}/questions/export?chapter_id={{chapter_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{teacher_token}}

### 预期响应（200 OK）：仅包含该章节下的题目的 .xlsx 文件

###

### 6.3 正常批量导入（使用 multipart/form-data 上传 .xlsx 文件）
###
### 用法（curl 示例）：
###   curl -X POST \
###     -H "Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN" \
###     -F "file=@questions.xlsx" \
###     http://localhost:8080/api/courses/{course_id}/questions/import
###
### Postman 用法：
###   Body → form-data → Key: file（类型选 File）→ Value: 选择 .xlsx 文件
###
### .http 文件无法直接发送 multipart 二进制，请使用 curl / Postman 测试
###
# @name import_questions_xlsx
# POST {{base}}/api/courses/{{course_id}}/questions/import
# Authorization: Bearer {{teacher_token}}
# Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----FormBoundary
# (需要在 curl / Postman 中上传 .xlsx 文件)

### 预期响应（200 OK）：
### {"total":N,"imported":M,"failed":F,"errors":[...]}

###

### 6.4 错误：未提供 file 字段
###
### curl -X POST \
###   -H "Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN" \
###   -H "Content-Type: multipart/form-data" \
###   http://localhost:8080/api/courses/{course_id}/questions/import
###
### 预期响应（400 Bad Request）：
### "请通过 multipart/form-data 上传名为 'file' 的 Excel 文件"

###

### 6.5 错误：上传损坏或非 xlsx 文件
###
### curl -X POST \
###   -H "Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN" \
###   -F "file=@not_an_excel.txt" \
###   http://localhost:8080/api/courses/{course_id}/questions/import
###
### 预期响应（400 Bad Request）：
### "无法解析 Excel 文件: ..."

###

### 6.6 部分成功（某些行校验失败）的预期返回示例
###
### 若上传的 Excel 中第3行题目类型填写了 "unknown_type"，第5行内容为空：
### 预期响应（200 OK）：
### {
###   "total": 5,
###   "imported": 3,
###   "failed": 2,
###   "errors": [
###     {"index": 2, "message": "第 3 行：无效题目类型 \"unknown_type\"，..."},
###     {"index": 4, "message": "第 5 行：题目内容（B列）不能为空"}
###   ]
### }

###

### 6.7 错误：非课程教师尝试导出
# @name export_unauthorized
GET {{base}}/api/courses/{{course_id}}/questions/export
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

###
### ============================================================
### 7. 学生答题全流程测试
###
### 前置条件：
###   - 已有课程 course_id（教师已创建并发布试卷）
###   - exam_id：已发布的试卷 ID
###   - student_token：已选课学生的 JWT token
###   - teacher_token：课程教师的 JWT token
###   - attempt_id：答题记录 ID（开始答题后获得）
###
### 变量约定（在 .env.http 或 IDE 环境变量中配置）：
###   @base = http://localhost:8080
###   @course_id = <your-course-uuid>
###   @exam_id = <your-exam-uuid>
###   @student_token = <student-jwt>
###   @teacher_token = <teacher-jwt>
### ============================================================
###

### 7.1 学生查看已发布试卷列表（已选课）
# @name student_list_exams
GET {{base}}/api/courses/{{course_id}}/exams
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

### 预期返回：200 OK，只包含 is_published=true 的试卷
### [
###   {
###     "id": "...",
###     "title": "期中考试",
###     "is_published": true,
###     "total_score": 100,
###     ...
###   }
### ]

###

### 7.2 学生查看试卷详情（含题目，correct_answer 为 null）
# @name student_get_exam
GET {{base}}/api/courses/{{course_id}}/exams/{{exam_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

### 预期返回：200 OK
### {
###   "exam": { "id": "...", "title": "期中考试", ... },
###   "questions": [
###     {
###       "question_id": "...",
###       "content": "以下哪个是 Rust 的所有权规则？",
###       "options": [...],
###       "correct_answer": null,   <- 学生不可见
###       "explanation": null,       <- 学生不可见
###       ...
###     }
###   ]
### }

###

### 7.3 学生开始答题
# @name start_attempt
POST {{base}}/api/courses/{{course_id}}/exams/{{exam_id}}/attempts
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

### 预期返回：201 Created
### {
###   "attempt_id": "<uuid>",   <- 保存此 ID 用于后续提交
###   "quiz_id": "{{exam_id}}",
###   "title": "期中考试",
###   "questions": [
###     {
###       "question_id": "...",
###       "question_type": "single_choice",
###       "content": "...",
###       "options": [...],
###       "score": 10.0
###     }
###   ]
### }
###
### 注意：将响应中的 attempt_id 设置到变量 @attempt_id

###

### 7.4 学生提交答案（自动评分客观题，问答题记 null 等待批改）
# @name submit_attempt
POST {{base}}/api/courses/{{course_id}}/exams/{{exam_id}}/attempts/{{attempt_id}}/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "answers": {
    "<single_choice_question_id>": "A",
    "<multiple_choice_question_id>": ["A", "C"],
    "<true_false_question_id>": true,
    "<essay_question_id>": "我认为Rust通过所有权系统实现内存安全，无需垃圾回收..."
  },
  "time_spent": 1800
}

### 预期返回（有问答题时）：200 OK
### {
###   "id": "{{attempt_id}}",
###   "score": 60.0,         <- 客观题自动得分（问答题待批）
###   "is_graded": false,    <- 有问答题未批改
###   "submitted_at": "...",
###   ...
### }
###
### 预期返回（全客观题时）：200 OK
### {
###   "score": 80.0,
###   "is_graded": true,
###   ...
### }

###

### 7.5 学生查看自己的答题历史
# @name get_my_attempts
GET {{base}}/api/courses/{{course_id}}/exams/{{exam_id}}/attempts/my
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

### 预期返回：200 OK，该学生在该试卷的所有历史记录
### [
###   {
###     "id": "...",
###     "score": 60.0,
###     "is_graded": false,
###     "submitted_at": "...",
###     ...
###   }
### ]

###

### 7.6 学生查看答题详情（提交后可见评分和解析）
# @name get_attempt_detail_student
GET {{base}}/api/courses/{{course_id}}/exams/{{exam_id}}/attempts/{{attempt_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

### 预期返回：200 OK
### {
###   "id": "{{attempt_id}}",
###   "score": 60.0,
###   "questions": [
###     {
###       "question_id": "...",
###       "question_type": "single_choice",
###       "student_answer": "A",
###       "earned_score": 10.0,
###       "is_correct": true,
###       "correct_answer": "A",      <- 提交后可见
###       "explanation": "A选项正确，因为..."  <- 提交后可见
###     },
###     {
###       "question_type": "essay",
###       "student_answer": "我认为...",
###       "earned_score": null,        <- 问答题待批改
###       "is_correct": null,
###       "correct_answer": null
###     }
###   ]
### }

###

### 7.7 教师查看所有学生的答题列表
# @name teacher_list_all_attempts
GET {{base}}/api/courses/{{course_id}}/exams/{{exam_id}}/attempts
Authorization: Bearer {{teacher_token}}

### 预期返回：200 OK，所有学生的答题记录列表

###

### 7.8 教师批改问答题（更新每题得分并重算总分）
# @name grade_essay
PUT {{base}}/api/courses/{{course_id}}/exams/{{exam_id}}/attempts/{{attempt_id}}/grade
Authorization: Bearer {{teacher_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "essay_scores": {
    "<essay_question_id>": 25.5
  }
}

### 预期返回：200 OK
### {
###   "id": "{{attempt_id}}",
###   "score": 85.5,          <- 客观题得分 + 问答题得分
###   "is_graded": true,      <- 全部批改完成
###   "question_scores": {
###     "<single_choice_id>": 10.0,
###     "<essay_question_id>": 25.5   <- 已更新
###   }
### }

###

### 7.9 学生再次查看（批改后可见完整评分）
# @name get_attempt_detail_after_grading
GET {{base}}/api/courses/{{course_id}}/exams/{{exam_id}}/attempts/{{attempt_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

### 预期返回：200 OK，所有题的 earned_score 均非 null，is_graded=true

###

### ---- 边界/错误场景 ----

### 7.10 错误：未选课学生尝试查看试卷列表
# @name unenrolled_list_exams
GET {{base}}/api/courses/{{course_id}}/exams
Authorization: Bearer {{unenrolled_student_token}}

### 预期：403 Forbidden "请先选课才能查看测试"

###

### 7.11 错误：学生尝试查看未发布试卷
# @name student_view_unpublished_exam
GET {{base}}/api/courses/{{course_id}}/exams/{{unpublished_exam_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

### 预期：404 Not Found "试卷不存在或尚未发布"

###

### 7.12 错误：重复提交同一次答题
# @name submit_already_submitted
POST {{base}}/api/courses/{{course_id}}/exams/{{exam_id}}/attempts/{{attempt_id}}/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "answers": {"<question_id>": "A"},
  "time_spent": 100
}

### 预期：400 Bad Request "该答题记录已提交，不能重复提交"

###

### 7.13 错误：超过最大答题次数后再次开始
# @name exceed_max_attempts
POST {{base}}/api/courses/{{course_id}}/exams/{{exam_id}}/attempts
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

### 预期：400 Bad Request "已达最大答题次数限制（N 次），无法再次作答"

###

### 7.14 错误：学生尝试批改（无权限）
# @name student_grade_attempt
PUT {{base}}/api/courses/{{course_id}}/exams/{{exam_id}}/attempts/{{attempt_id}}/grade
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "essay_scores": {"<essay_question_id>": 20.0}
}

### 预期：403 Forbidden "仅教师或管理员可批改问答题"

###

### 7.15 错误：学生尝试查看他人答题详情
# @name student_view_other_attempt
GET {{base}}/api/courses/{{course_id}}/exams/{{exam_id}}/attempts/{{other_student_attempt_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

### 预期：403 Forbidden "无权查看他人的答题记录"

### 预期响应（403 Forbidden）："仅课程教师或管理员可操作"
